# 6. Best Positioning Statement\
\
ISTSEH is a Kuwait/GCC-focused medication care assistant that combines smart routine-based scheduling, Arabic-friendly medication understanding, safety checks, and caregiver-linked family support, making it more personal and family-ready than generic pill reminder apps.\
