# 9. Short Pitch Version\
\
Most medication apps focus on reminders. ISTSEH goes further by helping users understand their medications, schedule doses around their real routine, check for safety risks, manage appointments, and connect caregivers to patient profiles through a secure family-code system.\
\
This makes ISTSEH especially suitable for Kuwait and the GCC, where medication care is often shared between patients, family members, and caregivers.\
